Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N01  START WITH ONE ACTION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fluent Me is a conversation-first English coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,This narrated tour uses real session captures to explain one focused feedback loop.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N02  CONTINUE TO START THE ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:16.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Tavus room starts only after the learner selects Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:22.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Topic, time box, and compact local recap remain optional choices.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N03  CAPTURE THE TAVUS ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:30.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,This chapter uses a short, continuous frame sequence captured while the Tavus coach was responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:39.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The sequence shows visible coach motion in that interval, not learner-audio transport or cleanup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:45.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The interface keeps the Face dominant while detailed tools stay in a drawer.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.00,0:00:48.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N04  READ THE TAVUS TRANSCRIPT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:50.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,After a captured turn, Feedback shows only evidence that exists:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:58.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,the Tavus transcript, timing, counted pauses or repeats, and available microphone or Raven signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:01.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,None becomes an opaque English score.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N05  GROUND ONE USEFUL CHANGE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:07.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The grounded review turns available evidence into one useful change.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:13.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Grammar and wording stay separate from pace and rhythm observations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Missing evidence stays hidden rather than guessed.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.00,0:01:21.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N06  DOCUMENT THE BOUNDARIES
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:21.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,History is opt-in and stored on this device.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:26.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The case study documents product, evidence, privacy, and lifecycle boundaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:32.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The captured motion does not prove learner audio transport or remote-room cleanup.
